        "id": 234950,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-01-29T13:56:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I almost forgot there was a one-shot this week! :O Had a pretty easy time getting a Mint, though. Lots of top-deck shenanigans for the heroes, though I took out Props Department accidentally when I might have benefited from not doing so. This team's got some good non-damaging one-shots, after all.</p>\n<p>Mostly, it came down to Defensive Blast with various buffs. :) Though I never had the cards in hand to pull it off with Unity's upgrade card, I ended up with both Twist the Ethers on Omnitron, and it was game over, man!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:11:10.158Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
